              "key": "1Cm",
              "role": "markdown",
              "content": [
                {
                  "code": "nl",
                  "parts": [
                    {
                      "str": "### Swabbing survey\n\nThank you for submitting your weekly symptoms questionnaire. To support our public health surveillance, UKHSA are offering eligible participants with specific symptoms the chance for a free postal respiratory swab test for a range of respiratory viruses. You have been directed to this page because you meet this respiratory swab test eligibility criteria based on your survey responses.\n\nThis respiratory swab test involves taking a sample from the back of your throat and from the inside of your nose collected using the same swab. Please note that currently self-swabbing is only open to participants over 18 years old and who live in England.\n\n \n\nIf you are reporting symptoms on behalf of someone else in your household, please answer these based on their details, and make sure to check that they are willing to participate."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
